VALUES (
  $T$kb-doc/system-standards/page-inventory$T$,
  $T${"blocks":[{"type":"Hero","props":{"lede":"Every page on this dashboard, classified against the locked architecture: **Knowledge** (BlockRenderer recipe, default for almost everything), **Structured** (bespoke React pulling specific DB fields — list pages, operator, kanban, animations), or **Unsure** (still hardcoded — needs converting). 113 routes total.","title":"Page inventory — every route, classified","eyebrow":"MJOS-054 · DASHBOARD STANDARDIZATION","subEyebrow":"Live tracking · last updated 2026-05-12"}},{"type":"LivingBanner","props":{"message":"**54** Knowledge (47.8%) · **41** Structured (36.3%) · **15** Unsure (13.3%) · 43 pages converted across 4 waves","pillLabel":"STATE OF PLAY"}},{"type":"SectionHeader","props":{"title":"Conversion timeline — Phase 1 complete: 43 converted, 4 locked Structured, 11 deleted","eyebrow":"00 — STATISTICS"}},{"type":"Grid3","props":{"cards":[{"h4":"43 converted","body":"**43 pages** moved from hardcoded React → Knowledge across 4 waves of parallel subagent dispatch. Each one: read JSX → compose BlockRenderer recipe → INSERT to page_content → replace component with a fetch-and-render shell.","h4ColorToken":"green","accentColorToken":"green"},{"h4":"25 reclassified","body":"**25 pages** moved from Unsure → Structured. 21 reclassified during the 4 conversion waves (slide carousels, kanbans, ReactFlow diagrams, iframe wrappers, Framer Motion, useContentPage edit-flavor). Plus 4 locked at Phase 1 closeout — `/knowledge-base`, `/settings`, `/space-game`, `/youtube-lab` — kept as intentional bespoke React.","h4ColorToken":"skyDark","accentColorToken":"skyDark"},{"h4":"11 deleted","body":"Phase 1 closed 2026-05-13. **11 pages deleted** as dead routes — test pages (`/test-page-01`, `/erez-test-two`, `/mcp-test`), easter eggs (`/pickle-rick`, `/rick-and-morty`), legacy duplicates (`/goals`, `/projects`), unused detail stubs (`/max-case-studies/:slug`, `/questionnaires/:slug`), and superseded surfaces (`/operator-a`, `/meetings/animated-flow`).","h4ColorToken":"red","accentColorToken":"red"}]}},{"type":"DataTable","props":{"rows":[["**Start**","Inventory shipped (MJOS-048)","11","19","80","—","—","`—`"],["**Wave 1**","16 dispatched — migrations / architecture / comparisons / strategy","24","22","64","13","3","`dd48c56, 3a8af67, b3d2825, 224bbb7, 6bf393e, 52c83e9`"],["**Wave 2**","16 dispatched — max-security / max-demos / voice / strategy","35","27","48","11","5","`cf79649, a56a036, b20b2e2, 9e3eaf9, f9730f2, f75ccf0, 8dd1a81, bde3027`"],["**Wave 3**","16 dispatched — business / architecture / ops / weekly","48","30","32","13","3","`b1e3c73, fe42c75, 71ce039, 688989c, c9e9129, c0707b2, 5b3c5ff`"],["**Wave 4**","16 dispatched — sales / decks / discovery / misc","54","41","15","6","10","`5551c30, add3b3b, 561f5e9, 2304826, f9298fb`"],["**Closeout**","Phase 1 standardize sweep — 4 locked Structured, 11 deleted","54","45","0","0","4","`MJOS-054 closeout sweep`"]],"headers":["Wave","What","K","S","U","+Knowledge","→Structured","Commits"]}},{"type":"QuoteBlock","props":{"body":"**Pattern earned:** every Knowledge page now follows the same shape — `<BlockRenderer config={architectureConfig} blocks={recipe} />` rendering a recipe stored in `page_content`. Pages are 30-line shells; content lives in Neon and edits ship without rebuild. The standardize goal Phase 1 conversion playbook is locked: this is the path every dashboard will inherit when we open the per-user template repo. **Phase 1 closed 2026-05-13** — inventory shows zero Unsure pages. Next gate: Phase 2 per-tenant migrate."}},{"type":"TOC","props":{"items":["Summary","How to read this","Knowledge pages","Structured pages","Unsure — closed out","Redirects"]}},{"type":"SectionHeader","props":{"title":"Counts at a glance","eyebrow":"01 — SUMMARY"}},{"type":"Grid3","props":{"cards":[{"h4":"54 Knowledge","body":"Data in any table, layout is a BlockRenderer recipe. The default architecture. Every domain detail page lives here.","h4ColorToken":"green","accentColorToken":"green"},{"h4":"45 Structured","body":"Bespoke React pulling specific DB fields. List pages, operator, kanban. Intentional — the layout is reactive, not a recipe.","h4ColorToken":"skyDark","accentColorToken":"skyDark"},{"h4":"0 Unsure","body":"Phase 1 closed 2026-05-13. All 15 resolved — 4 reclassified Structured (`/knowledge-base`, `/settings`, `/space-game`, `/youtube-lab`); 11 deleted as test/duplicate/dead routes.","h4ColorToken":"green","accentColorToken":"green"}]}},{"type":"Divider","props":{}},{"type":"SectionHeader","props":{"title":"Three buckets","eyebrow":"02 — HOW TO READ THIS"}},{"type":"UL","props":{"items":["**Knowledge** — Component imports and renders `<BlockRenderer>`. Recipe may live inline in the TSX, or be loaded from `page_content`, `skills.body`, `tickets.body`, `goals.body`, or `projects.body`. Every detail page should be here.","**Structured** — Component is bespoke React that queries the DB for specific fields and renders a custom layout. List pages (SortableTable + `/api/<resource>`), operator dashboards, kanban boards. Intentional non-Knowledge.","**Unsure** — Component returns hardcoded JSX with no DB and no BlockRenderer. These are the **conversion candidates** — each one should become either Knowledge (most common — move content to `page_content` row + delete the bespoke component) or Structured (if it genuinely needs custom React + DB queries)."]}},{"type":"Divider","props":{}},{"type":"SectionHeader","props":{"title":"Already on the locked architecture (54)","eyebrow":"03 — KNOWLEDGE PAGES"}},{"type":"DataTable","props":{"rows":[["[`/block-library`](/block-library)","`BlockLibraryPage`","Inline recipe — block showcase"],["[`/claude-bedrock-israel`](/claude-bedrock-israel)","`ClaudeBedrockIsraelPage`","Inline recipe"],["[`/dashboard-architecture`](/dashboard-architecture)","`DashboardArchitecturePage`","Inline recipe — architecture doctrine"],["`/goals/:slug`","`GoalDetailPage`","Renders goals.body recipe"],["